        "name": "USN-5685-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that FRR incorrectly handled parsing certain BGP messages. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause FRR to crash, resulting in a denial of service. (CVE-2022-37032)  It was discovered that FRR incorrectly handled processing certain BGP messages. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause FRR to crash, resulting in a denial of service, obtain sensitive information, or execute arbitrary code. (CVE-2022-37035)",
